<main class="page"><span class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-recycle"></i> Refill order</span><div class="intro"><h1>Set up your water refill.</h1><p>Tell us the gallon size and quantity you are returning. You will confirm your delivery details and payment in the existing secure checkout.</p></div><div class="progress"><span><i>1</i> Set up refill</span><b></b><span><i>2</i> Sign in</span><b></b><span><i>3</i> Confirm &amp; pay</span></div>
<div class="layout"><form class="setup" id="refill-form"><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><span class="number">1</span><div><h2>Choose your gallon size</h2><p>Select the empty container you will return.</p></div></div><div class="size-grid"><label class="size selected"><input type="radio" name="container_size" value="5gal-round" checked><i class="fa-solid fa-bottle-water"></i><strong>19L Round</strong><span>Classic household gallon</span></label><label class="size"><input type="radio" name="container_size" value="5gal-slim"><i class="fa-solid fa-bottle-water"></i><strong>19L Slim</strong><span>Space-saving shape</span></label><label class="size"><input type="radio" name="container_size" value="2.5gal-slim"><i class="fa-solid fa-glass-water"></i><strong>9.5L Slim</strong><span>Compact everyday option</span></label></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><span class="number">2</span><div><h2>How many gallons?</h2><p>Bring out the same number of empty containers for exchange.</p></div></div><div class="row"><div><strong>Purified-water refill</strong><small>Your empty gallon is exchanged during delivery or at pickup.</small></div><div class="quantity"><button type="button" data-adjust="-1" aria-label="Decrease quantity">−</button><output id="quantity">1</output><button type="button" data-adjust="1" aria-label="Increase quantity">+</button><input type="hidden" id="quantity-input" value="1"></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><span class="number">3</span><div><h2>Choose fulfillment</h2><p>Choose a delivery schedule or collection time after login.</p></div></div><div class="fulfillment"><label class="selected"><input type="radio" name="fulfillment" value="delivery" checked><i class="fa-solid fa-truck"></i><div><strong>Deliver to my address</strong><span>Confirm a delivery window next.</span></div></label><label><input type="radio" name="fulfillment" value="pickup"><i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i><div><strong>Pick up at station</strong><span>We will prepare your refill for collection.</span></div></label></div></section></form>
<aside class="review"><h2>Your refill setup</h2><p class="review-intro">No payment is taken yet.</p><ul class="review-list"><li><span>Refill size</span><strong id="review-size">19L Round</strong></li><li><span>Quantity</span><strong id="review-quantity">1 gallon</strong></li><li><span>Container return</span><strong>Yes</strong></li><li><span>Receive by</span><strong id="review-fulfillment">Delivery</strong></li></ul><p class="note"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i><span>Make sure your empty gallon is ready. Your final price, address, schedule, and payment are confirmed at checkout.</span></p><a class="continue" id="create-continue" href="create_account.php?order_type=refill&amp;container=existing&amp;container_size=5gal-round&amp;quantity=1&amp;fulfillment=delivery">Create account to continue <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><a class="login" id="login-continue" href="user/scan_qr.php?order_type=refill&amp;container=existing&amp;container_size=5gal-round&amp;quantity=1&amp;fulfillment=delivery">Already registered? Log in with mobile number or QR <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></aside></div></main>
<script>const form=document.getElementById('refill-form'),q=document.getElementById('quantity'),qi=document.getElementById('quantity-input');function sync(){const size=form.querySelector('input[name="container_size"]:checked').closest('.size').querySelector('strong').textContent,qty=Number(qi.value),fulfillment=form.querySelector('input[name="fulfillment"]:checked').value;document.getElementById('review-size').textContent=size;document.getElementById('review-quantity').textContent=`${qty} ${qty===1?'gallon':'gallons'}`;document.getElementById('review-fulfillment').textContent=fulfillment==='delivery'?'Delivery':'Station pickup';const p=new URLSearchParams({order_type:'refill',container:'existing',container_size:form.querySelector('input[name="container_size"]:checked').value,quantity:String(qty),fulfillment});document.getElementById('create-continue').href=`create_account.php?${p}`;document.getElementById('login-continue').href=`user/scan_qr.php?${p}`};form.querySelectorAll('input[type="radio"]').forEach(input=>input.addEventListener('change',()=>{form.querySelectorAll('.size,.fulfillment label').forEach(e=>e.classList.remove('selected'));form.querySelector('input[name="container_size"]:checked').closest('.size').classList.add('selected');form.querySelector('input[name="fulfillment"]:checked').closest('label').classList.add('selected');sync()}));form.querySelectorAll('[data-adjust]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{qi.value=Math.max(1,Number(qi.value)+Number(button.dataset.adjust));q.textContent=qi.value;sync()}));sync();</script></body></html>
